{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39423","headline":"出自蓟北门行 · 王贞白","name":"出自蓟北门行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓟北连极塞，塞色昼冥冥。\n战地骸骨满，长时风雨腥。\n沙河留不定，春草冻难青。\n万户封侯者，何谋静虏庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}